$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM To a solution of 2-bromothiophenol (2.44g, 12.89 mmol) in ethanol (60.0
ml) was added 1-fluoro-4-nitrobenzene (1.5 mL, 14.17 mmol) and K2CO3
(2.14g, 15.46 mmol). The mixture was heated at reflux for an overnight
and after cooling, the mixture was filtered. The organic layer was
concentrated in-vacuo and the residue dried under vacuum. The crude
product, yield 100%.
