$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM A stirred solution of diiodide 17 (780 mg, 1.06 mmol) in anhydrous NMP
(10 mL) at rt under N2 was treated with Et3N (1.2 mL, d = 0.726, 0.87 g,
8.63 mmol). Tris(dibenzylideneacetone)dipalladium(0) (Pd2(dba)3, 48 mg,
53 µmol, 5 mol%) and 1,1´-bis(diphenylphosphino)ferrocene (dppf, 117 mg,
212 µmol, 20 mol%) were then added and the resulting dark purple mixture
was sparged with a steady stream of N2 for 20 min. During this time, the
reaction mixture became orange in color. Benzyl mercaptan (1.0 mL, d =
1.06, 1.06 g, 8.5 mmol) was then added and the mixture was heated to 85
°C. Over the next 21 h, five further additions of Pd2(dba)3 (48 mg, 5
mol%) and dppf (117 mg, 20 mol%) in dry NMP (1.0 mL) were made to the
reaction mixture at regular intervals. The reaction mixture was allowed
to cool to rt and partitioned between H2O (70 mL) and EtOAc (70 mL). The
two layers were separated and the aqueous phase was extracted (EtOAc, 70
mL). The combined organic phases were washed successively with H2O (3x70
mL) and brine (2x40 mL), and then dried (Na2SO4) and concentrated in
vacuo. The resulting residue was further purified by column
chromatography (eluting with EtOAc) to give bisthioether 20 (772 mg, 1.05
mmol, 99%) as a pale yellow solid. Recrystallization from THF gave
colorless prisms: mp 176-178 °C (THF); IR (neat) 2974, 1717, 1583, 1495,
1268, 1148, 1061, 924, 844, 783, 697, 542 cm-1; 1H NMR (500 MHz, d6-DMSO,
T = 373 K) δ 8.57 (2H, dd, J = 4.0, 1.5 Hz), 8.23 (2H, dd, J = 8.3, 1.5
Hz), 8.03 (2H, s), 7.44-7.41 (4H, m), 7.39 (2H, dd, J = 8.3, 4.0 Hz),
7.34-7.30 (4H, m), 7.26 (2H, tt, J = 7.0, 1.2 Hz), 4.33 (2H, d, J = 12.5
Hz), 4.30 (2H, d, J = 12.5 Hz), 2.97 (4H, dq, J = 14.0, 7.0 Hz), 2.83
(4H, dq, J = 14.0, 7.0 Hz), 0.69 (12H, br t, J = 7.0 Hz) ppm; 13C NMR
(125 MHz, d6-DMSO, T = 373 K) δ 150.9 (2C, 0), 148.8 (2C, 1), 148.0 (2C,
0), 146.1 (2C, 0), 136.7 (2C, 1), 133.9 (2C, 1), 131.2 (2C, 0), 128.3
(4C, 1), 127.7 (4C, 1), 126.8 (2C, 0), 126.5 (2C, 1), 125.4 (2C, 0),
120.0 (2C, 1), 40.6 (4C, 2), 37.3 (2C, 2), 12.3 (4C, 3) ppm; MS (ES+) m/z
731 (M+H)+; HRMS (ES+) m/z 731.2714 (calcd. for C42H43N4O432S2:
731.2726); Anal. calcd. for C42H42N4O4S2: C, 69.01; H, 5.79; N, 7.67; S,
8.77. Found: C, 68.75; H, 5.75; N, 7.40; S, 8.75.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM Pd catalyst and dppf ligand added 5 times during 2nd stage
